{"id":"la_grima","lemma":"lágrima","pos":"noun","rank":1782,"glosses":["tear, teardrop"],"ipa":"/ˈlaɡɾima/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"lágrimas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-l%C3%A1grima.wav","examples":[{"text":"No derramó ni una lágrima.","en":"He didn't shed a tear."},{"text":"Ella se enjugó las lágrimas.","en":"She wiped away her tears.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/50797"},{"text":"Una lágrima rodaba en su mejilla.","en":"A tear rolled down her cheek."},{"text":"No pude controlar mis lágrimas.","en":"I couldn't control my tears.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639264"},{"text":"Ella intentó no derramar ni una lágrima.","en":"She tried not to shed a tear."}]}